  "goodToKnow": "Der Völkermord is genocide; the synonym der Genozid is also used. The Holocaust, the murder of six million European Jews, is the central Völkermord of German history, and Holocaust denial is a crime in Germany. In 2016 the Bundestag recognised the Armenian genocide, and in 2021 Germany acknowledged the genocide of the Herero and Nama in colonial Namibia. Das Volk means people or nation. Plural: die Völkermorde."
